\"\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong \"helvetica=\"\" \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" 0.544px;font-size:=\"\" arial,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" neue\",=\"\" pingfang=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"font-family: \" system-ui,=\"\" ui\",=\"\" var(--articlefontsize);\"=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\"><br/></span></strong></span></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong \"helvetica=\"\" \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" 0.544px;font-size:=\"\" arial,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" neue\",=\"\" pingfang=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"font-family: \" system-ui,=\"\" ui\",=\"\" var(--articlefontsize);\"=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">关于Café Origen Palestine</span></strong></span></section><section \"helvetica=\"\" \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" 0.544px;white-space:=\"\" 0px;\"=\"\" 0px;margin-top:=\"\" 1.75em;margin-bottom:=\"\" arial,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" neue\",=\"\" normal;line-height:=\"\" pingfang=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-family: \" system-ui,=\"\" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">Café Origen Palestine是来自慧兰省的一个高品质咖啡合作社集团，成立于2015年，是一个家庭协会，执行和开发农产品项目，专注对咖啡的生产、商业化、转型和营销等活动。</span></section><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7S6UhIcprq6fpHNddkVicv7KKqTAdF9ACP7sKcLXicE2R6y4PqzmjRdf2v7fJIpgmQuiaCicxMNzGkozg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section \"helvetica=\"\" \"hiragino=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" -apple-system,=\"\" 0.544px;white-space:=\"\" 0px;\"=\"\" 0px;margin-top:=\"\" 1.75em;margin-bottom:=\"\" arial,=\"\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\"\" gb\",=\"\" neue\",=\"\" normal;line-height:=\"\" pingfang=\"\" sans=\"\" sans-serif;letter-spacing:=\"\" sc\",=\"\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-family: \" system-ui,=\"\" ui\",=\"\" yahei=\"\" yahei\",=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\"></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">创始人Linarco Rodriguez除了管理合作社集团的事务外，还有3个自己的农场Finca Betania, El Diviso和El Bosque</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">；这是一个很典型的从大宗商业豆转型到精品咖啡的代表/例子，早些年Palestine合作社对外的咖啡业务是要么直接售卖咖啡鲜果或者是传统水洗处理完的带壳豆，比较简单和稳定；但相应的品质等级也停留在大宗商业等级，这几年随着咖啡市场的细分发展，以及有聚焦在精品市场的贸易商的频繁接触和影响，合作社开始有机会尝试做一些精品批次，然后有了尝试就会有正向的反馈，有国际市场对于风味的认可，合作社才得意继续扩大精品的处理规模；到目前为止，Café Origen Palestine合作社已签订在国内和国际供应咖啡的协议，供应范围包括欧洲、美国、澳大利亚、韩国和中国。 他们有一个储藏仓库、一个咖啡实验室和自己的农场，生产精品咖啡。 他们与117家供应商咖啡种植者合作，通过运用蜜处理、日晒、水洗和长时间发酵等处理法来丰富了他们的产品线。</span></span></section><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"\"/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7S6UhIcprq6fpHNddkVicv7KNlCkwSib7O6G6ggcT4jyxPxrRcdyP1oWPITocJbz6llO6u1xmTPOia6g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\"></span></span></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">关于本批次处理方式</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：</span></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1- 鲜果采摘，手选<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">‍</span><span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">‍</span><span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">‍</span><span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">‍</span><span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">‍</span><span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">‍</span><span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\"></span></span></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">2- 浮选<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">‍</span><span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\"></span></span></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3- 脱皮<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">‍</span><span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">‍</span><span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\"></span></span></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">4- 放入发酵罐发酵72小时</span></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">5- 清洗果胶<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">‍</span><span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">‍</span><span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\"></span></span></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">6- 晾晒</span></section><section \"helvetica=\"\" \"hiragino=\"\" \"mic